{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40121","label":"COIN RUSH SHOWDOWN · Part 1"},"label":"An Awkward? Situation: A","stage":null,"prev":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01","next":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_e","speakers":{"mustang":"Mustang","ingrid":"Ingrid","syuen":"Syuen","mana_b":"Mana","flora_b":"Flora","guilty_b":"Guilty","sin_b":"Sin","ade_b":"Ade","milk_b":"Milk","mast_m":"Mast","privaty_m":"Privaty","soda_b":"Soda","anchor_m":"Anchor"},"icons":{"mustang":"si_c902_00_s","ingrid":"si_c900_00_s","syuen":"si_c901_00_s","mana_b":"si_c290_01_s","flora_b":"si_c411_01_s","guilty_b":"si_c404_00_s","sin_b":"si_c405_00_s","ade_b":"si_c315_00_s","milk_b":"si_c143_00_s","mast_m":"si_c354_00_s","privaty_m":"si_c313_00_s","soda_b":"si_c314_00_s","anchor_m":"si_c355_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_1","text":"Oh là là, la compétition has become très intense, more than I anticipated!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Office","bgArt":"office","image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_cir_smoothoperation","movie":null,"shown":["mustang","ingrid","syuen"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_2","text":"I thought it was un bon concept, but...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_3","text":"This all happened because Missilis became blinded by their desire to win.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_4","text":"What are you on about? Did you seriously think we're here to play nice and have a good time instead of fighting to win?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_5","text":"There's still a line you don't cross.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_6","text":"Ingrid, arrête.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_7","text":"Sûrement, you've noticed it too, non?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_8","text":"... Yes, but I just couldn't resist teasing Missiles.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_9","text":"Unfortunately, it's not yet time. For now, we should wait and see how this plays out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_10","text":"D'accord.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_11","text":"Hey! What are you two whispering about?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_12","text":"I'm warning you. If you two are plotting to screw over Missilis, you'd better be ready for the consequences.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_13","text":"Because I'll stop at nothing to get what I want. Got it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_14","text":"C'est horrible! My body is trembling in shock.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_15","text":"Also, what's the deal with that head of security? Why's he acting so cocky?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_16","text":"What's wrong with bending the rules or getting a little physical in a competition? Why's he making such a fuss? Who does he think he is?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_17","text":"Ahh, I get it now. The organizers, Elysion, and Tetra... you're all in cahoots, aren't you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_18","text":"Oh, this personne est un higher-up from le Central Government.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_19","text":"... What?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_20","text":"He est très sincère about entertainment. In fact, he's l'organiser of Coin Rush Showdown.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_21","text":"He's even overseeing la compétition.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_22","text":"I was impressed his dévotion to entertainment, that's why I let him rent Coin Rush pour la compétition.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_23","text":"Wait... I thought he was the head of security?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_24","text":"There's a time limit on this arrangement. Once la compétition ends, he must retourner to his original post.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_25","text":"Seriously... Why is he so obsessed with entertainment?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_26","text":"Haha! C'est what entertainment is all about!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_27","text":"For crying out loud, stop yelling all of a sudden!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_28","text":"I'm starting to get hungry. Shall we get something to eat?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_29","text":"As a matter of fact, I've already prepared le dîner. It will arrive très soon.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_30","text":"I see. I appreciate it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_31","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_32","text":"Bien sûr, your portion is included, Syuen. Calme, calme.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_33","text":"Ha! Do I look like I have time to sit around and have a nice little meal with the both of you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_34","text":"Oui.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_35","text":"It would be rude to turn down a personal dinner invitation from the CEO of Tetra.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_36","text":"There will be a lot of délicieux cakes, too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_37","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_38","text":"Fine. I guess I could eat with you this time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_39","text":"Good grief. It's not easy appeasing a child.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_40","text":"Y-you little...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_41","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_41","text":"We're all sitting in the restaurant, having our meal.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CoinRushDrinkZone","bgArt":"coinrushdrinkzone","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":["mana_b","flora_b","guilty_b","sin_b"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_42","text":"Ahhh...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_43","text":"This soup is perfect for a hangover. Now I can drink some more.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_btg_mini_3","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_44","text":"Hmm... I wonder if I can get some of this to go.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_45","text":"Are you planning on drinking, curing your hangover, and then drinking some more?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_46","text":"Indeed. That way I can remain intoxicated.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_47","text":"And I can make sure I'm not drunk at the same time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_48","text":"Only those who observe me can determine my state.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_49","text":"Wouldn't you say that this is the very pinnacle of quantum mechanics?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_50","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_50","text":"From my observation, I'd say you're very drunk.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_51","text":"That aside, we're getting quite a few intense looks.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_52","text":"I can barely eat in peace.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_04_s_